  m_text: "It was a day as average as any other. You could hear the footsteps of
    your coworkers as they left the building, hurrying along to clock out. Unfortunately
    for you, there was stuff you needed to get done before you could leave as well.
    But you were so close to finishing it...so very close\u2026"
