  m_text: "But I'm a merciful man, so if you can finish every single job that there
    is to do in this building before 6 am I won't fire you.\r\n\r\nProtagonist: I...
    don't think that's legal.\r\n\r\nBoss: If I cared about what\u2019s legal or
    not this company would\u2019ve gone down long ago! Now, I don\u2019t pay you
    to judge my morality, get to work or you\u2019re fired!"
